{
  "category": "Evolution Pokémon",
  "entries": [
    {
      "text": "Its genetic code is irregular. It may mutate if it is exposed to radiation from element STONEs.",
      "version": "red"
    },
    {
      "text": "Its genetic code is irregular. It may mutate if it is exposed to radiation from element STONEs.",
      "version": "blue"
    },
    {
      "text": "Its genetic code is unstable, so it could evolve in a variety of ways. There are only a few alive.",
      "version": "yellow"
    },
    {
      "text": "It has the ability to alter the composition of its body to suit its surrounding environment.",
      "version": "gold"
    },
    {
      "text": "Its irregularly configured DNA is affected by its surroundings. It evolves if its environment changes.",
      "version": "silver"
    },
    {
      "text": "Its ability to evolve into many forms allows it to adapt smoothly and perfectly to any environment.",
      "version": "crystal"
    },
    {
      "text": "EEVEE has an unstable genetic makeup that suddenly mutates due to the environment in which it lives. Radiation from various STONES causes this POKéMON to evolve.",
      "version": "ruby"
    },
    {
      "text": "EEVEE has an unstable genetic makeup that suddenly mutates due to the environment in which it lives. Radiation from various STONES causes this POKéMON to evolve.",
      "version": "sapphire"
    },
    {
      "text": "An EEVEE has an unstable genetic makeup that suddenly mutates due to its environment. Radiation from various STONES causes this POKéMON to evolve.",
      "version": "emerald"
    },
    {
      "text": "An extremely rare POKéMON that may evolve in a number of different ways depending on stimuli.",
      "version": "firered"
    },
    {
      "text": "Its genetic code is irregular. It may mutate if it is exposed to radiation from element STONES.",
      "version": "leafgreen"
    },
    {
      "text": "A rare Pokémon that adapts to harsh environments by taking on different evolutionary forms.",
      "version": "diamond"
    },
    {
      "text": "A rare Pokémon that adapts to harsh environments by taking on different evolutionary forms.",
      "version": "pearl"
    },
    {
      "text": "Because its genetic makeup is irregular, it quickly changes its form due to a variety of causes.",
      "version": "platinum"
    },
    {
      "text": "It has the ability to alter the composition of its body to suit its surrounding environment.",
      "version": "heartgold"
    },
    {
      "text": "Its irregularly configured DNA is affected by its surroundings. It evolves if its environment changes.",
      "version": "soulsilver"
    },
    {
      "text": "Because its genetic makeup is irregular, it quickly changes its form due to a variety of causes.",
      "version": "black"
    },
    {
      "text": "Because its genetic makeup is irregular, it quickly changes its form due to a variety of causes.",
      "version": "white"
    },
    {
      "text": "Thanks to its unstable genetic makeup, this special Pokémon conceals many different possible evolutions.",
      "version": "black-2"
    },
    {
      "text": "Thanks to its unstable genetic makeup, this special Pokémon conceals many different possible evolutions.",
      "version": "white-2"
    },
    {
      "text": "A rare Pokémon that adapts to harsh environments by taking on different evolutionary forms.",
      "version": "x"
    },
    {
      "text": "Thanks to its unstable genetic makeup, this special Pokémon conceals many different possible evolutions.",
      "version": "y"
    },
    {
      "text": "Eevee has an unstable genetic makeup that suddenly mutates due to the environment in which it lives. Radiation from various stones causes this Pokémon to evolve.",
      "version": "omega-ruby"
    },
    {
      "text": "Eevee has an unstable genetic makeup that suddenly mutates due to the environment in which it lives. Radiation from various stones causes this Pokémon to evolve.",
      "version": "alpha-sapphire"
    },
    {
      "text": "Possessing an unbalanced and unstable genetic makeup, it conceals many possible evolutions.",
      "version": "sun"
    },
    {
      "text": "Current studies show it can evolve into an incredible eight different species of Pokémon.",
      "version": "moon"
    },
    {
      "text": "The question of why only Eevee has such unstable genes has still not been solved.",
      "version": "ultra-sun"
    },
    {
      "text": "Its genes are easily influenced by its surroundings. Even its face starts to look like that of its Trainer.",
      "version": "ultra-moon"
    },
    {
      "text": "It can evolve into a variety of forms. Eevee’s genes are the key to solving the mysteries of Pokémon evolution.",
      "version": "lets-go-pikachu"
    },
    {
      "text": "It can evolve into a variety of forms. Eevee’s genes are the key to solving the mysteries of Pokémon evolution.",
      "version": "lets-go-eevee"
    },
    {
      "text": "It has the ability to alter the composition of its body to suit its surrounding environment.",
      "version": "sword"
    },
    {
      "text": "Thanks to its unstable genetic makeup, this special Pokémon conceals many different possible evolutions.",
      "version": "shield"
    },
    {
      "text": "Harbors the potential to evolve into manifold forms. Within Eevee lies the key to the mysteries of Pokémon evolution—I'm certain of it.",
      "version": "legends-arceus"
    }
  ],
